timedia workspace for recording, editing, and production support.","evidence_claim":"The Studio provides multimedia tools and assistance, including a One Button Studio, Whisper Rooms, and editing bays.","source_url":"https://library.tamu.edu/spaces/the-studio","source_title":"The Studio | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in Evans Annex Room 3.653; Studio spaces can be reserved through the library’s reservation link.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tamu-maker-zone","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Maker Zone","title":"The Maker Zone","subtitle":"Texas A&M University Libraries","notes":"Bring a valid Aggie ID, check the open-studio or workshop schedule, and ask staff before using unfamiliar machines or materials.","short_summary":"An experiential learning space for campus-affiliated makers, with workshops and open-studio time.","evidence_claim":"The Maker Zone is an experiential learning space for current Texas A&M students, faculty, and staff, with workshops and open studio times.","source_url":"https://library.tamu.edu/about/welcome-new-students.php","source_title":"Welcome New Students | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A valid Aggie ID is required; follow staff direction and equipment safety policies while using the space.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tamu-math-learning-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Math Learning Center","title":"Math Learning Center","subtitle":"Evans Library, second floor","notes":"Use the center’s tutoring, study sessions, workshops, or weekly reviews to work through quantitative course material with academic support.","short_summary":"A campus academic unit